<LanguageData>
  <Hediff_PersonalityExcreting_Thought.stages.0.label>我的肚子好脹</Hediff_PersonalityExcreting_Thought.stages.0.label>
  <Hediff_PersonalityExcreting_Thought.stages.0.description>我的肛門被注射了某種液體，涼涼的，塞滿了我的肚子，好難受。</Hediff_PersonalityExcreting_Thought.stages.0.description>
  <Hediff_PersonalityExcreting_Thought.stages.1.label>腦袋昏昏</Hediff_PersonalityExcreting_Thought.stages.1.label>
  <Hediff_PersonalityExcreting_Thought.stages.1.description>我的意識開始變得有些模糊，每次隨著呼吸，我都能感覺到那團粘液在直腸裡晃動，這種令人羞恥的異物感讓我無法集中精神思考。</Hediff_PersonalityExcreting_Thought.stages.1.description>
  <Hediff_PersonalityExcreting_Thought.stages.2.label>好難受</Hediff_PersonalityExcreting_Thought.stages.2.label>
  <Hediff_PersonalityExcreting_Thought.stages.2.description>思考變得好睏難...好想把身體裡的那坨東西拉出來，可我必須憋住。</Hediff_PersonalityExcreting_Thought.stages.2.description>
  <Hediff_PersonalityExcreting_Thought.stages.3.label>嗝...啊哈哈哈，唔！！</Hediff_PersonalityExcreting_Thought.stages.3.label>
  <Hediff_PersonalityExcreting_Thought.stages.3.description>不行，大腦已經空了，好想拉出來，好想被艹。</Hediff_PersonalityExcreting_Thought.stages.3.description>
</LanguageData>